WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Politics can feel like something that happens to you — a feed of headlines.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.500
I believe awareness is active. Paying attention is a choice.

00:06.500 --> 00:09.500
Sharing what you’re learning is a choice. Reaching out is a choice.

00:09.500 --> 00:12.500
Showing up doesn’t always mean a protest sign or a podium.

00:12.500 --> 00:15.500
This space is for that kind of showing up — personal, curious, unfinished on purpose.
